{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/c6a3ac69a62f7760300ee28bf2c238c0.avif?t=1751316458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras_big/c6a3ac69a62f7760300ee28bf2c238c0.avif?t=1751316458 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of two penguins, Flare and Breeze, far from their icy home, as they journey through a blooming springtime world in this charming pixel art puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Springuins</i>, you control Flare\u2014but when you collect a cherry blossom, Breeze wants to follow its scent for a few precious steps, synchronizing their movement. Use this mechanic to navigate tight puzzles and reunite the pair across vibrant, handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/a03a89d70e6f1af6d67b6094a8faa2b7.avif?t=1751316458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras_big/a03a89d70e6f1af6d67b6094a8faa2b7.avif?t=1751316458 width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique one-controls-two puzzle mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite-sized levels full of clever movement challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute retro-style pixel art with a charming color palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy soundtrack to waddle along with.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring Flare and Breeze together?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644860?t=1751316458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/57986f7561523b95db8546ca085e3a6e18f131a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751316458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/f4e63193cf0320fb3559412107851e9403538482/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751316458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/f4e63193cf0320fb3559412107851e9403538482/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751316458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/c6a3ac69a62f7760300ee28bf2c238c0.avif?t=1751316458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras_big/c6a3ac69a62f7760300ee28bf2c238c0.avif?t=1751316458 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of two penguins, Flare and Breeze, far from their icy home, as they journey through a blooming springtime world in this charming pixel art puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Springuins</i>, you control Flare\u2014but when you collect a cherry blossom, Breeze wants to follow its scent for a few precious steps, synchronizing their movement. Use this mechanic to navigate tight puzzles and reunite the pair across vibrant, handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras/a03a89d70e6f1af6d67b6094a8faa2b7.avif?t=1751316458\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/extras_big/a03a89d70e6f1af6d67b6094a8faa2b7.avif?t=1751316458 width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique one-controls-two puzzle mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite-sized levels full of clever movement challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute retro-style pixel art with a charming color palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy soundtrack to waddle along with.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring Flare and Breeze together?</p>","developers":["fall"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644860/5f8390aeae44d6e8113599bbc35d7fe29bf2d75c/header.jpg?t=1751316458","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 13.3+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 128 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 15.5<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any modern sound card</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3644860/197656334/342d5b9c431ad6905bdbdb6e532cda3a5721daca/1750973182/dash_av1.mpd?t=17